OL,3,GNEWSAHave tractor runs become a
OL,4,AChristmas tradition?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey began as small local events with
OL,7,Ffarmers driving fairy-lit tractors
OL,8,Fthrough local towns and villages to
OL,9,Fbring a smile and raise money for good
OL,10,Fcauses.
OL,12,FNow there are hundreds of festive
OL,13,Ftractor runs held across the British
OL,14,FIsles in the run up to Christmas - with
OL,15,Fcrowds lining the streets to see the
OL,16,Fparades.
OL,18,FOrganisers of the events said the trend
OL,19,Fappeared to be gathering steam with
OL,20,Fmore popping up across the country.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
